// @effect semantics "UM の kernel の意味の決まり（ゼロ除算・シフト・変換・NaN・範囲外の添字など）を試す効果（試験用）"
// @param a 1 -4..4 "値 a"
// @param b 0.25 -4..4 "値 b"
//
// 出力の層の x と y は、整数の結果をまとめたハッシュ、z と w は f32 の結果。
// CPU（UM 本体）・GPU（WGSL）・wasm で、ビットが同じになることを確かめるためのもの。

const K: i32[4] = [7, -3, 0, -2147483647];
const U: u32[3] = [0, 1, 4294967295];
const B: bool[2] = [true, false];
const F: f32[3] = [0.5, -1.25, 3.0e38];

kernel function semMix(h: u32, x: u32): u32 {
  return (h ^ x) * 16777619;
}

// f32 の値を、整数の変換 3 通りでハッシュに混ぜる（NaN・無限大・範囲外も決まった値になる）。
kernel function semMixF(h: u32, x: f32): u32 {
  let r = semMix(h, x as u32);
  r = semMix(r, (x * 65536.0) as i32 as u32);
  r = semMix(r, (x * -0.001) as i32 as u32);
  if (x != x) {
    r = semMix(r, 77);
  }
  return r;
}

kernel function semLoop(n: u32): u32 {
  let acc: u32 = 0;
  for (let k: u32 = 0; k < n; k++) {
    if (k % 3 == 1) {
      continue;
    }
    if (acc > 400) {
      break;
    }
    for (let m = 0; m < 3; m++) {
      acc += k * (m as u32) + 1;
    }
  }
  return acc;
}

kernel function semantics(i: u32, out: mut Buffer<vec4<f32>>, src: Buffer<vec4<f32>>, src2: Buffer<vec4<f32>>, w: u32, h: u32, time: f32, p: f32[8]): void {
  const c = out[i];
  const d = src[((i as i32) - 1) as u32];
  const e = src2[i + w * h];
  let hh: u32 = 2166136261;
  // 整数（NaN は 0、範囲外は飽和）
  const xi = (c.x * 4000.0 - 2000.0) as i32;
  const yi = (c.y * 8.0 - 4.0) as i32;
  const xu = (c.z * 4294967296.0) as u32;
  const yu = (c.w * 70.0) as u32;
  const mn = -2147483647 - 1;
  hh = semMix(hh, (xi / yi) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, (xi % yi) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, (mn / (yi - yi - 1)) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, (mn % (yi - yi - 1)) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, ((-xi) % 7) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, xu / yu);
  hh = semMix(hh, xu % yu);
  hh = semMix(hh, (xi >> yi) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, (xi << yi) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, xu >> yu);
  hh = semMix(hh, xu << yu);
  hh = semMix(hh, Math.shl(xu, yi));
  hh = semMix(hh, Math.shr(xi, yu) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, (Math.popcount(xu) + Math.clz(xu) * 33 + Math.ctz(xu) * 1089) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, Math.clz(yu - yu) + (Math.ctz(yi - yi) as u32));
  hh = semMix(hh, Math.abs(xi * 1073741824 + mn) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, (Math.min(xi, yi) as u32) ^ Math.max(xu, yu));
  hh = semMix(hh, ((~xu) & 0xff00ff00) | (xu ^ 0x5555));
  hh = semMix(hh, (xi * xi * xi) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, 0 - xu);
  hh = semMix(hh, (-mn) as u32);
  // f32 から整数（飽和・NaN）
  hh = semMix(hh, (c.x * 1.0e10) as i32 as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, (c.y * -1.0e10) as u32);
  hh = semMix(hh, (c.z / (c.w - c.w)) as i32 as u32);
  // 整数から f32（2^24 を超える値の丸め）
  const big = xu | 0x1000001;
  hh = semMixF(hh, big as f32);
  hh = semMixF(hh, (xi * 1234567) as f32);
  hh = semMixF(hh, mn as f32);
  hh = semMixF(hh, (true as u32) as f32);
  // 定数どうしの計算（WGSL の定数式で誤りにならないこと）
  const ct1: i32 = 7 / 0;
  const ct2: i32 = 2147483647 + 1;
  const ct3 = 3.0e38 + 3.0e38;
  const ct4: i32 = 1 << 40;
  const ct5: i32 = -(-2147483647 - 1);
  const ct6: i32 = 5 % 0;
  const ct7: i32 = 65536 * 65536;
  hh = semMix(hh, (ct1 + ct2 + ct4 + ct5 + ct6 + ct7) as u32);
  hh = semMixF(hh, ct3 - 1.0);
  // 配列（範囲外の添字は最後の要素）
  hh = semMix(hh, (K[i % 7] as u32) ^ U[xi]);
  if (B[i % 3]) {
    hh = semMix(hh, 1);
  }
  // f32 の演算
  let fs = c.x / c.y + Math.sqrt(c.z - 0.5) + Math.floor(c.w * 7.5) - Math.ceil(c.x * -3.3);
  fs = fs + Math.min(c.x, c.y) * Math.max(c.z, d.x) + Math.abs(-c.w);
  fs = fs + F[i % 5] * 1.0e-30 + p[i % 11] * p[0] - p[1] / 3.0;
  fs = fs * 1.0000001 + c.x * c.y - c.z * c.w;
  hh = semMixF(hh, fs);
  hh = semMixF(hh, Math.min(c.x, d.y));
  hh = semMixF(hh, Math.max(d.y, c.x));
  hh = semMixF(hh, Math.sqrt(c.y * 1000.0));
  hh = semMixF(hh, c.z / 3.0);
  hh = semMixF(hh, 1.0 / c.w);
  // ループ（continue・break・入れ子・do-while）。上限（65536 回）を超えて回らないようにする（超えると UM 本体と結果が変わる）
  let n = 0;
  do {
    n++;
  } while (n < yi && n < 1000);
  hh = semMix(hh, semLoop(yu) + (n as u32));
  // ベクトル
  const v = vec4(c.x, c.y, d.z, d.w) * 3.0 / vec4(c.w, 0.0, -0.0, d.x) - e * time;
  let q = -v;
  q.y = q.y * 0.5;
  hh = semMixF(hh, q.x + q.y + q.z + q.w);
  const z = (big > 3000000000) ? q.x : q.w;
  out[i] = vec4((hh >> 8) as f32, (hh & 0xff) as f32, fs + time, z);
}
